Description:

Email/query can now sort by "emailState", as its sort options have always
advertised (misspelled as "emailstate").  Sorting by the misspelled name
crashed httpd; it is now rejected as an unsupported sort.


Documentation:

None.


Config changes:

None.


Upgrade instructions:

Clients that sent "emailstate" because the server advertised it should send
"emailState" instead.


